  "headline": "Secondary Landslide Severs Jalan Langgar II In Pejaten Timur",
  "seoTitle": "Landslides Hit Multiple South Jakarta Locations",
  "metaDescription": "A secondary landslide in Pejaten Timur, South Jakarta, has cut off access on Jalan Langgar II, prompting the local government to fast-track repairs.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "A secondary landslide occurred at Jalan Langgar II, Pejaten Timur, South Jakarta, causing a complete severance of the road.",
    "Heavy rainfall was identified as the trigger for the instability, which has also resulted in local flooding and forced residents to evacuate.",
    "The Jakarta provincial government has announced plans to accelerate the construction of permanent retaining walls to secure the affected area."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Following a series of intense rainfall events, a secondary landslide has struck Jalan Langgar II in Pejaten Timur, South Jakarta, severely disrupting local transportation and infrastructure. The incident, which originated in the RT 007/RW 010 neighborhood, rendered the road impassable and blocked access toward the Poltangan area. Beyond the structural damage to the road, the landslide and associated flooding have forced residents to evacuate their homes as water levels rose. In response to the recurring instability, the Jakarta provincial government has pledged to prioritize the development of permanent retaining walls to mitigate future risks at the site. The area remains under observation as officials assess the extent of the damage to the local drainage systems and residential properties in the vicinity of the Pasar Minggu district.",
